Input: {"question": "Who is the artist of the album \"Brand New Me\"?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0385-35262e5afa3d:d00", "start": 0, "end": 122, "text": "A Brand New Me (Aretha Franklin album) A Brand New Me is a compilation album by American recording artist Aretha Franklin."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0385-35262e5afa3d:d00", "start": 123, "end": 199, "text": "It was released on November 10, 2017, by Rhino Records and Atlantic Records."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0385-35262e5afa3d:d00", "start": 200, "end": 491, "text": "The album features archival vocal recordings that Franklin recorded for Atlantic Records accompanied by new orchestral arrangements by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra and newly recorded backing vocals, in addition to the original (archived) background vocal and instrumental accompaniments."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0385-35262e5afa3d:d00", "start": 492, "end": 603, "text": "Producer Nick Patrick said of the album: \"There is a reason that Aretha Franklin is called the 'Queen of Soul.'"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0385-35262e5afa3d:d00", "start": 604, "end": 655, "text": "There is nothing more exciting than that incredible"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0385-35262e5afa3d:d01", "start": 0, "end": 26, "text": "Chad ( 23 January 2018 ) ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0385-35262e5afa3d:d01", "start": 27, "end": 111, "text": "`` Aretha Franklin Meets the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra on ' A Brand New Me ' `` ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0385-35262e5afa3d:d01", "start": 112, "end": 128, "text": "popmatters.com ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0385-35262e5afa3d:d01", "start": 129, "end": 141, "text": "PopMatters ."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0385-35262e5afa3d:d01", "start": 142, "end": 167, "text":